INT. EMPTY INDOOR TENNIS COURT - DAWN

Green carpet. Sodium lamps coming up. A basket of balls.

OTIS BRAITHWAITE-NKOSI (40s, track jacket) feeds balls from the basket. Across the net, LEONTYNE "LEO" AMAECHI-DAHL (16, racket too big for her) returns them. Thock. Thock. Thock.

OTIS
Again.

LEO
Again.

They speak at the same time.

OTIS
Reset your feet.

LEO ^
I'm resetting my feet.

OTIS
Then reset them faster.

Thock. She hits wide. He doesn't flinch.

LEO
Coach.

OTIS
Leo.

LEO
Same time tomorrow?

OTIS
Same time.

She smiles. He feeds another ball.
